      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAYTON MAGIC (2) goes very well this trip starting 21 times for nine wins and six minors. Recorded a 3 length win (24.42) in a Grade 4/5 last time at this track. With a clean break looks hard to beat. CAWBOURNE OZZY (8) recorded a Grade 4/5 win two back then missed the frame last time at Wentworth Park, but drawn Box 8 this time where he has won before. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. IRINKA ALANA (1) was out of the placings last time but shapes well for this on her blistering win the start prior, getting around Temora over 330m in 18.73. Should be in this for a long way. TIN ROOF RUSTY (5) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
